WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.132 --> 00:00:03.723
- I'm very, very predicated
on running a marathon

00:00:03.723 --> 00:00:06.075
in a world that I think is
running a sprint.

00:00:06.075 --> 00:00:08.128
I think when we think about 2014

00:00:08.128 --> 00:00:09.936
and I think about 
the entrepreneurs

00:00:09.936 --> 00:00:12.731
in this room and the marketers
and the brands that I work with

00:00:12.731 --> 00:00:16.374
we live in a world where
people lack patience.

00:00:16.374 --> 00:00:19.231
We just don't have patience 
and I promise you that

00:00:19.231 --> 00:00:22.550
if you're able to whether it's
financially or emotionally

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:25.478
put yourself in a position 
to have patience

00:00:25.478 --> 00:00:28.057
you have a far better 
chance of succeeding.

00:00:28.057 --> 00:00:30.694
Your decision making 
path becomes far

00:00:30.694 --> 00:00:33.203
clearer and you build 
much more leverage

00:00:33.203 --> 00:00:37.292
to actually build wealth or
work-life balance or

00:00:37.292 --> 00:00:40.017
legacy or whatever makes you tick.

00:00:40.017 --> 00:00:42.531
(techno music)

